 example, and this is particularly true with heritage languages - this isn't hypothetical - I know plenty of people who have learned some Welsh, because their great, great-grandfathers came from Wales Americans who discovered those, somebody who came from wealth country, heritage, exactly that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S08","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":8,"global_order":8,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So for those people, it can be a genuine, emotional success of real value to them.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S09","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":9,"global_order":9,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If they learn how to say four or five sentences, which actually they can do in a day.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S10","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":10,"global_order":10,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So if you say to somebody like that, we've got an approach here, which if you do, an hour, each year, In four or five years is going to have you at a place where you've filled that emotional need and you feel really good about it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S100","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":100,"global_order":100,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm like, are you okay?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S101","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":101,"global_order":101,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm just gonna, Oh, we finished.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S102","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":102,"global_order":102,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Oh, very And that's uptake.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S103","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":103,"global_order":103,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But so now I've come away from there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S104","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":104,"global_order":104,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"He learned 70% of a sentence or one complete sentence and the beginning of another one.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S105","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":105,"global_order":105,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"He hasn't had anybody - this is about, must be about a year and a half ago - he's not had anybody on his show since then slagging off the Welsh language.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S106","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":106,"global_order":106,"spea