":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S113","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":113,"global_order":113,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Give me some evidence.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S114","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":114,"global_order":114,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"really, can you back this up, he's not going to take anybody in his show, just to mouth off about Welsh without serious evidence now.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S115","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":115,"global_order":115,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I see that connection point.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S116","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":116,"global_order":116,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So there's just a little emotional connection and that in terms of the public storyline, there's just a slight little, a little extra filter there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S117","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":117,"global_order":117,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So if somebody's got something, a legitimate story about something that did go wrong and involve the language in some way.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S118","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":118,"global_order":118,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S119","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":119,"global_order":119,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm sure he'd run with that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S12","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":12,"global_order":12,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah and this is something that I became a little bit more sensitized to when I was going down to to London for that Jeremy Vine stuff, because I went down thinking okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S120","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":120,"global_order":120,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But the unsubstantiated, no, 'they're all like this' stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S121","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":121,"global_order":121,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"He's just automatically going - he's not going to think.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S122","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":122,"global_order":122,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Oh, I'm not sure Aran would like this, I'd better not.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S123","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":123,"global_order":123,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"He's just going to think 'really?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S124","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":124,"global_order":124,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And he's going to ask those extra couple of questions, so suddenly the sort of baseless negative story becomes a little bit harder to get through.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S125","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":125,"global_order":125,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Now, if we could reach 20 or 30 opinion formers in London and give all of them one sentence, then I think the kind of media discussion you get of Wales and Welsh potentially changes dramatically.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S13","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":13,"global_order":13,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Jeremy's a nice guy and he's been really positive about this.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S14","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":14,"global_order":14,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S15","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":15,"global_order":15,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And I'm sure that for everybody else down there, his production teams, his editors, his producers, all those people are going to be okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S16","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":16,"global_order":16,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"'Jeremy has got this bee in his bonnet and there's this Welsh guy coming down, they'll probably burn our studio' and what actually happened on the day that we, we did his, we did a sort of whimsical little bit on his TV program in the morning, and then did the sort of proper learning stuff on radio too.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S17","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":17,"global_order":17,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And I'm sure.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S18","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":18,"global_order":18,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I got introduced to two different sets of crews and editors and so on different vines.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S19","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":19,"global_order":19,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S20","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":20,"global_order":20,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That's the one.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S21","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":21,"global_order":21,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm going to have to, ping him with that - that's a good one and basically everybody, I was introduced to said something to me in Welsh.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S22","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":22,"global_order":22,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"they'd all prepped a word or two in Welsh.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S23","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":23,"global_order":23,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And none of them came at me.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S24","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":24,"global_order":24,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I think there was one Welsh speaker in there, so they know there was a guy who can, I think I did a bit foggy on it now.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S25","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":25,"global_order":25,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I think I did meet one Welsh speaker in there, who'd obviously gravitated to welder to wash thing happening, but for everybody else it was, Oh, hang on.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S26","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":26,"global_order":26,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S27","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":27,"global_order":27,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S28","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":28,"global_order":28,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and, in the basket she goes, the thing is that we would always say, and it's certainly in terms of language activism, you'd go.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S29","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":29,"global_order":29,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yep, fine.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S30","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":30,"global_order":30,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Classic tokenism - hell with you.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S31","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":31,"global_order":31,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That's just not helpful.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S32","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":32,"global_order":32,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And we've been utterly wrong about that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S33","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":33,"global_order":33,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Every single one of those people, their effort to speak two or three words of Welsh to me immediately formed an emotional connection that would otherwise not have been there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S34","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":34,"global_order":34,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I was immediately able to give them praise to look obviously happy.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S35","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":35,"global_order":35,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We had that kind of energy connection, just like that on a plate - did not require them to have learned anything else.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S36","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":36,"global_order":36,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S37","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":37,"global_order":37,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And I've realized now that this is actually, this is as far as Welsh is concerned that this is an outreach program and it's not about saying, we need to get, we need to get more people to learn Welsh.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S38","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":38,"global_order":38,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That's a thing we need to do that and people are working at that","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S39","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":39,"global_order":39,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Well, we want to make it easier for people to learn Welsh.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S40","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":40,"global_order":40,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yes.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S41","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":41,"global_order":41,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"exactly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S42","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":42,"global_order":42,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But also.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S43","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":43,"global_order":43,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Also we've got, when you think in terms of, relationships, attitudes.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S44","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":44,"global_order":44,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S45","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":45,"global_order":45,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Stories, we've got now.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S46","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":46,"global_order":46,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I would say let's look at the case of Jeremy Vine.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S47","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":47,"global_order":47,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So the reason we ended up doing some stuff together was he'd got himself into hot water because he had some Twitter storm.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S48","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":48,"global_order":48,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S49","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":49,"global_order":49,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"he'd had, that'd be something about Wales is part of Britain so everybody should speak English or, he wasn't actually trying to say anything nasty at all.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S50","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":50,"global_order":50,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"He'd just being slightly misunderstood and hadn't expressed himself perfectly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S51","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":51,"global_order":51,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then he said, sorry, and that kind of stuff, but he'd also, he'd had somebody on his show previously with that hoary old chestnut: I went into a pub and they all stopped speaking English and started speaking Welsh.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S52","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":52,"global_order":52,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And what was this magical tool you use to listen to them before you went into the pub?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S53","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":53,"global_order":53,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S54","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":54,"global_order":54,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And of course, one of the reasons that myth is so deeply embedded is because there's this very interesting little confirmation bias thing: when you hear people who are bilingual, in informal conversational settings, you will usually hear them using bits of both languages.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S55","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":55,"global_order":55,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and it may be rarely, it may be very frequently.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S56","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":56,"global_order":56,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"They might be code switching dramatically, or maybe be just one or two words.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S57","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":57,"global_order":57,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But when you hear one word, of a language you understand your brain will tell you that conversation was in that language.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S58","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":58,"global_order":58,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If you're bilingual, your brain will just be wrong.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S59","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":59,"global_order":59,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S60","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":60,"global_order":60,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So a monoglot will think, I heard the word fridge.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S61","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":61,"global_order":61,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So they were speaking English.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S62","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":62,"global_order":62,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Now I listen carefully, oh theyre speaking Welsh - they've changed languages because I'm here.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S63","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":63,"global_order":63,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I can see that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S64","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":64,"global_order":64,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S65","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":65,"global_order":65,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then they don't think, but how did they know?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S66","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":66,"global_order":66,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I don't speak Welsh.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S67","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":67,"global_order":67,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Oh, I'm wearing my, 'I don't speak Welsh' T-shirt.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S68","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":68,"global_order":68,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That's how they knew.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S69","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":69,"global_order":69,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But there aren't any of those, it's fun.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S70","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":70,"global_order":70,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"it's fascinating.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S71","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":71,"global_order":71,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It seems it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S72","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":72,"global_order":72,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Oh gosh.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S73","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":73,"global_order":73,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S74","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":74,"global_order":74,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That was a rude thing to do.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S75","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":75,"global_order":75,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"They shouldn't have done that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S76","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":76,"global_order":76,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But then when you say, could you hear them before you went in the pub, were you wearing anything that showed you didn't speak Welsh?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S77","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":77,"global_order":77,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Did you listen to them carefully before revealing your presence?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S78","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":78,"global_order":78,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"All these things just fall down...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S79","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":79,"global_order":79,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"which is not to say that nobody has ever been at a bar, been talking to this friend in English because they don't speak Welsh and then turning to this friend to speak Welsh.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S80","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":80,"global_order":80,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But I have never met anybody, I don't believe it has ever happened where two people who speak English to themselves, basically your relationship with somebody tends to be a linguistic relationship.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S81","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":81,"global_order":81,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So somebody I speak English to, even if they speak Welsh, if I formed a relationship, I've got plenty of examples of this, parents and children who both speak Welsh, but because they grew up speaking English at home, still speak English to each other, despite both being fluent Welsh speakers and switching, that can be quite challenging.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S82","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":82,"global_order":82,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So broadly speaking, you'll stick in the same language.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S83","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":83,"global_order":83,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Per person.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S84","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":84,"global_order":84,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S85","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":85,"global_order":85,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But this idea that there's a whole bunch of Welsh people out there who - it's also begs the question - it's got that really interesting colonial kind of idea that Welsh isn't really a thing, of course, they're speaking English to each other all the time, they just use Welsh when they want me not to understand what they're saying, not a thing!","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S86","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":86,"global_order":86,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I, we had this - going down there - I had this kind of sense that, And where were we?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S87","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":87,"global_order":87,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"the connection and the welcome and like kind of stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S88","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":88,"global_order":88,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Oh yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S89","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":89,"global_order":89,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So why he was doing it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S90","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":90,"global_order":90,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and then.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S91","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":91,"global_order":91,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So when I saw the response and the sense down there, I started thinking this, actually, this is more than tokenism.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S92","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":92,"global_order":92,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So then I taught him how to say one sentence on radio.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S93","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":93,"global_order":93,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then of course we didn't, he kept wanting to play songs and stuff like that, which interrupts the process.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S94","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":94,"global_order":94,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But he did really well.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S95","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":95,"global_order":95,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"He got as far as: I want to learn to speak Welsh now I want to learn to speak Welsh today because And I found it very frustrating...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S96","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":96,"global_order":96,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I had to leave after, because I want you to finish that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S97","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":97,"global_order":97,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And we were really close.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S98","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":98,"global_order":98,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I just wanted to teach him because it's interesting because, but they were making cut the throat signs at me.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC01-S99","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":1,"scene_label":"Chapter 1","scene_title":"The Myth of Talking Welsh in A Pub When English People Come In","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":99,"global_order":99,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And I was very slow to realize that, man, they wanted me to leave the studio.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S01","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":1,"global_order":126,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So then if you extrapolate from that to other languages, if you want to say we've got, we've got an environment here where there's conflict and there's distrust.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S02","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":2,"global_order":127,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And there are groups of people who are not getting on with each other.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S03","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":3,"global_order":128,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Clearly, nobody's really going to buy into, the solution is to teach group A, how to speak language of group B fluently and teach group B how to speak language of group A fluently.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S04","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":4,"global_order":129,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And that would be a great solution and it would work, but a very long thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S05","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":5,"global_order":130,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But actually, if you can teach group A how to say one sentence, In language B and group B to say one sentence in language A, you probably immediately got a significant dampening effect because you've got real emotional connections...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S06","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":6,"global_order":131,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"then in terms of your - what's your road to learning?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S07","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":7,"global_order":132,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah, I think they're all out there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S08","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":8,"global_order":133,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And any individual may want to go down different roads for different languages","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S09","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":9,"global_order":134,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"For all these different reasons, as you said.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S10","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":10,"global_order":135,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So we've got to test.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S100","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":100,"global_order":225,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"You go 'wow, that's great' but if you see the reaction in other people's faces at the same time, it makes it a different level of emotional connection.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S101","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":101,"global_order":226,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Similarly, watching a movie on a plane is okay, watching a movie with someone you really like at the same time in a room, you've got that shared thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S102","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":102,"global_order":227,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And I think that's something that I'm really interested in because of schools and training centers.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S103","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":103,"global_order":228,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So I'd quite like to unpack that and get your perspective on all the different ways, your experience of doing intensives, your experience of doing these sprints.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S104","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":104,"global_order":229,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"What that might look like.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S105","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":105,"global_order":230,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I think that would be really interesting for me, certainly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S106","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":106,"global_order":231,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And maybe it's selfish because it might not be as interesting.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S107","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":107,"global_order":232,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"You might be thinking: technology, AI, ML, individuals at massive scale.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S108","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":108,"global_order":233,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I'm also thinking about this wonderful community.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S109","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":109,"global_order":234,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Aspects of learning.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S11","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":11,"global_order":136,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S110","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":110,"global_order":235,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I think, I think it's absolutely essential.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S111","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":111,"global_order":236,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I think the community learning is, that's where we start to get to a new layer of human experience.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S112","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":112,"global_order":237,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and I think if, if you're trying to say let's, let's get everybody to be lifelong learners because it's healthy and improves society and all that kind of stuff then you know, you're doing the right thing and you're going in the right direction.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S113","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":113,"global_order":238,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And if you get a bunch of individuals to be like that, great, but anywhere you can get a community to be a lifelong learning community, you've just absolutely changed the game.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S114","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":114,"global_order":239,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I think it's, no, this is not less interesting for me, this is front and center.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S115","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":115,"global_order":240,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I originally thought.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S116","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":116,"global_order":241,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That it wouldn't be possible to use a methodology in a group setting.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S117","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":117,"global_order":242,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Why was that?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S118","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":118,"global_order":243,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It just seemed to me that, you've got a prompt, you've got a challenge to produce it in the target language.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S119","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":119,"global_order":244,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If somebody else produces it ahead of you they've just removed your learning from you that hasn't helped you that's actually actively handicapped you.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S12","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":12,"global_order":137,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We've got to say how many people will show an interest.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S120","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":120,"global_order":245,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So are you doing it in a class setting?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S121","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":121,"global_order":246,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Do you get everybody to try and say, it's at the same time, that starts to feel a bit robotic.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S122","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":122,"global_order":247,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then you've got people who are just shadowing very carefully, very quickly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S123","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":123,"global_order":248,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And so I thought, yeah, it's not a classroom tool.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S124","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":124,"global_order":249,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's about you do this work, independently.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S125","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":125,"global_order":250,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then in the group setting, you're doing playful use of content.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S126","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":126,"global_order":251,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then I started getting people getting in touch with me, teachers getting in touch and saying, we've been doing it in the classroom.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S127","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":127,"global_order":252,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And it's working fantastically.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S128","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":128,"global_order":253,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Oh my God, I did not expect that to be a thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S129","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":129,"global_order":254,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So then we've gone on into, we've done a bit just stuff with intensives five day, 10 day intensives.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S13","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":13,"global_order":138,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If we say learn X in an hour a month, how many people want to do an hour a year?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S130","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":130,"global_order":255,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm trying to figure out group sizes there - a lot of which for us was driven by trying to figure out how to make them things, to which we actually turn a profit on it instead of losing money on them.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S131","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":131,"global_order":256,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S132","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":132,"global_order":257,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S133","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":133,"global_order":258,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah, more important than I expected.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S134","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":134,"global_order":259,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And I've I found myself - in terms of the work I'm willing to do the, I now basically, only agree to do one on one stuff - because I know in a one on one environment that, whatever, the context there, I know we can get that to work.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S135","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":135,"global_order":260,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So what I found with whatever, the","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S136","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":136,"global_order":261,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"working memory of the person, you can calibrate","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S137","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":137,"global_order":262,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"exactly that, and you can give them an experience which will give them increased confidence, increased self esteem, all that kind of stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S138","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":138,"global_order":263,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"what I found with groups, and so this is this is for me, this is the challenge.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S139","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":139,"global_order":264,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's about group formation.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S14","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":14,"global_order":139,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"How many people want to do one day a month or one day per year?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S140","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":140,"global_order":265,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If you get, if you get four people together for five days in a bed and breakfast in rural Wales, and one of them is not a very nice person.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S141","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":141,"global_order":266,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You've got four people who are not going to get a very good learning experience.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S142","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":142,"global_order":267,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Of course.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S143","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":143,"global_order":268,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And in fact, that's not an anything to do the intensive that's to do with, as you say, group formation.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S144","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":144,"global_order":269,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Exactly.",