,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If you haven't done it in a group, which is the group has achieved success, it's achieved communicative levels of confidence.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S191","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":191,"global_order":316,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And when you meet those guys in the pub, even if you just bump into them, it's Oh yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S192","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":192,"global_order":317,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"A little bit of this language now, and that is incredibly valuable!","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S193","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":193,"global_order":318,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S194","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_nu