number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":204,"global_order":329,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And I could easily imagine that you end up with a sort of learning community, maybe you have a dozen people who are your learning community and you're just moving through several different things that you're learning together as a group.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S205","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":205,"global_order":330,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then sometimes you'll split and reform into other groups and that's fine.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S206","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":206,"global_order":331,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But then you have these sort of increased webs of connection, but their webs of learning connection.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S207","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":207,"global_order":332,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S208","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":208,"global_order":333,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So instead of it just being, we live just down the road from you.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S209","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":209,"global_order":334,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If you're interested in A, B and C and let's pop around for a cup of tea because I feel like a conversation about it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S21","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":21,"global_order":146,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S210","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":210,"global_order":335,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I can feel that conversation in Swahili.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S211","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":211,"global_order":336,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So is it like a book club kind of meets a learning type thing where they're getting together?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S212","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":212,"global_order":337,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Cause they've got the shared interest and it's that sort of collaboration, collaborative exploration that,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S213","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":213,"global_order":338,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"but also as the personal connection grows, you don't...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S214","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":214,"global_order":339,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and this is probably one of the big myths.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S215","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":215,"global_order":340,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Isn't it?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S216","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":216,"global_order":341,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That learning is fundamentally utilitarian instead of fundamentally about personal play and discovery.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S217","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":217,"global_order":342,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S218","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":218,"global_order":343,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Maybe learning is really a mechanism by which to have meaningful group interaction.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S219","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":219,"global_order":344,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S22","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":22,"global_order":147,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"That's exactly right.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S220","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":220,"global_order":345,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S221","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":221,"global_order":346,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah, because rather than just","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S222","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":222,"global_order":347,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"meeting up to just go for the hell of it, if we're doing something for it gives, Oh, it's an excuse to get together in the same way as, yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S23","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":23,"global_order":148,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then as you do more and more of that, you document it, you film it, you show it happening and then you show people, look so what you get, then you have this kind of interesting combination you were talking about, roots and guidance previously.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S24","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":24,"global_order":149,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And how you don't say to somebody, well there are 80 million different ways for you to do this, so good luck.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S25","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":25,"global_order":150,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S26","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":26,"global_order":151,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You say, so you want to go from Cambridge to Caernarfon yeah, satnav says there are 18,000 different ways to do that, but this is what I'm suggesting you go like this.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S27","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":27,"global_order":152,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So what we then get is that combination.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S28","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":28,"global_order":153,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We have an, which makes us, a good fit for AI later on - we say, yep, just Press Play.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S29","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":29,"global_order":154,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And we're going to take care of it for you.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S30","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":30,"global_order":155,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We're going to take you the right way,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S31","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":31,"global_order":156,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"but you have to then before they press play, you have to work out what their learning goals are?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S32","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":32,"global_order":157,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"No, not necessarily.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S33","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":33,"global_order":158,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I think you just press play When they stop play - we notice that they've stopped play.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S34","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":34,"global_order":159,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So we start to do things like when they come back and press play again, we notice that it's been a month.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S35","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":35,"global_order":160,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Okay.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S36","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":36,"global_order":161,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So in that case, we might want to throw some of these earlier seed sentences back in here.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S37","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":37,"global_order":162,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If they come back the next day, we can just press on, but then the other thing you're saying to them is in terms of, so that's Netflix layer.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S38","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":38,"global_order":163,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"But then when you get into piano school layers and more one on one stuff, what you're saying is, here is a really wide menu of approaches you can take, you can go 10 days intensive, straight away, and be having a conversation on day 11.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S39","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":39,"global_order":164,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Or you can say, I want to do one day a year for the next 10 years.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S40","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":40,"global_order":165,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Or you can take any kind of pattern within that and these are all functional, but I think you end up saying the models we're willing to offer are these because you've got your scale is not helpful.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S41","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":41,"global_order":166,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"that's fine.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S42","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":42,"global_order":167,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"It's like you don't - IKEA don't make ALL the different ranges.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S43","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":43,"global_order":168,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"They're small, medium, large for like chairs, or whatever, you know exactly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S44","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":44,"global_order":169,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Shoe sizes aren't analog, they're digital, they're quantized, aren't they?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S45","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":45,"global_order":170,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Really a little bit.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S46","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_