9,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And that was a day.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S55","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":55,"global_order":180,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'd say, if you're going to spend this day,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S56","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":56,"global_order":181,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"is it a hundred hours?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S57","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":57,"global_order":182,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And tech is 10 hours, 10 hours a year is 100 hours.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S58","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":58,"global_order":183,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's a hundred hours.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S59","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":59,"global_order":184,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Chop them how you want, but that's going to get you there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S60","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":60,"global_order":185,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Hundred hours of our system.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S61","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":61,"global_order":186,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I'm really, yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S62","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":62,"global_order":187,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Interested in unpacking a little bit, the sprint idea, because of course you talked about how one of the reasons we got together is because I read - to give a little bit of background.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S63","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":63,"global_order":188,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I was looking at accelerated learning.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S64","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":64,"global_order":189,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I was looking at all these different things anyway, and accelerated language acquisition is a great test.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S65","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":65,"global_order":190,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And so I thought I'm going to see to what extent this is possible.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S66","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":66,"global_order":191,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I read a bunch of books and the one that resonated most with me was the High Intensity.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S67","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":67,"global_order":192,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Language Training, the HILT method.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S68","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":68,"global_order":193,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And I researched the author, found out that the author wasn't actually that far away the author was in North Wales.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S69","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":69,"global_order":194,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I thought that's interesting.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S70","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":70,"global_order":195,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So I followed the author on Twitter and then I reached out to him and suggested, I think we had a Skype call.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S71","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":71,"global_order":196,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I said, listen, I'm doing some interesting stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S72","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":72,"global_order":197,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I had a Skype call.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S73","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":73,"global_order":198,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And then the great story, and this is, I said, we've got these kids and where, the 16 year old, six formers, they want to learn Portuguese.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S74","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":74,"global_order":199,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And we're, we're looking at all the various ways of doing it and intensive period of time.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S75","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":75,"global_order":200,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"We're only gonna allocate two hours a day and we want, in six weeks time to see what we can do.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.698693+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S76","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":76,"global_order":201,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And he goes, when are you starting?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S77","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":77,"global_order":202,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I said, because it's half term.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S78","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":78,"global_order":203,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So we said, we can start on Monday.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S79","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":79,"global_order":204,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So I'll come down.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S80","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":80,"global_order":205,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And this crazy guy.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S81","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":81,"global_order":206,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah, Aran Jones, he, drove down from North Wales to Cambridge and then just kicked it all off.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S82","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":82,"global_order":207,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And so that was remarkable - that level of commitment was really interesting.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S83","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":83,"global_order":208,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"But the whole point, what really resonated with me was the high intensity.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S84","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":84,"global_order":209,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"My experience of accelerated learning was that high-intensity - even if you do it with big gaps - high intensity is remarkable in the Seth Godin sense, then it will mean you will talk about it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S85","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":85,"global_order":210,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"You will remark on it because yeah, if you experienced...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S86","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":86,"global_order":211,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S87","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":87,"global_order":212,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I learned that so quickly, this astonishing, and you feel the neural adaptation, you feel that stuff.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S88","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":88,"global_order":213,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So I think if you want to create that kind of - if you want to change how learners see themselves so that they can then apply this new sense of identity as a learner to other contexts, high intensity learning seems to be the obvious way to do it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S89","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":89,"global_order":214,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So I said, so what I'd like to do","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S90","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":90,"global_order":215,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"because this is recording and since you just called me mad, I would like to point out that you have literally just driven from Cambridge to the North of Wales, just for a chat.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S91","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":91,"global_order":216,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah, exactly.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S92","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":92,"global_order":217,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And we arranged it, with a similar sort of short notice.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S93","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":93,"global_order":218,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S94","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":94,"global_order":219,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"What are you doing this week?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S95","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":95,"global_order":220,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I've got something to do on Tuesday.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S96","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":96,"global_order":221,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I'll come up Wednesday then.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S97","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":97,"global_order":222,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"no, you're completely right.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S98","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":98,"global_order":223,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So what I'd like to do for the context of all the things that we're trying to do, I'd like to unpack the idea of this in more detail about how to deliver it in the piano lesson model.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC02-S99","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":2,"scene_label":"Chapter 2","scene_title":"Language Learning Can Bridge Gaps","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":99,"global_order":224,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Where you all really, leveraging the group energy and that collaboration and that sense of listen, let's say a bunch of us in a room and we're all presented with a magic trick on a one to one.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S01","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":1,"global_order":348,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So one of my metaphors for intensive sprints, when we're talking about learning sprints in general, not necessarily languages, but obviously language is a brilliant thing is the road trip.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S02","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":2,"global_order":349,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Cause what you want to, what is a road trip?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S03","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":3,"global_order":350,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"it's flexible.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S04","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":4,"global_order":351,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"According to the people, they decide where to go, it's temporary.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S05","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":5,"global_order":352,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S06","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":6,"global_order":353,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"you're going to form incredibly strong bonds.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S07","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":7,"global_order":354,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"There'll be challenges, psychological challenges because you're with inter-railing group trips, road trips, those sorts of things.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S08","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":8,"global_order":355,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"But you know that at the end of this three, four days, long weekend, whatever, 10 days you'll have this - you've created this, something that exists that's as a result of this, between this thing, this entity and that road, and it will always bring back tremendously fond memories.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S09","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":9,"global_order":356,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So I wonder whether that is the metaphor for the group side of things.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S10","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":10,"global_order":357,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"You're going on a learning journey with people, but it's not just you it's the road trip!","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S11","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":11,"global_order":358,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Trip.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S12","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":12,"global_order":359,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S13","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":13,"global_order":360,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I Like the road trip, really.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S14","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":14,"global_order":361,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I think that might be quite nice.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S15","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":15,"global_order":362,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And I I also think that, think it goes.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S16","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":16,"global_order":363,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Then even wider than that, you'll have multiple road trips sometimes with the same group.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S17","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":17,"global_order":364,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Sometimes you can get sometimes with overlap and do a tour because we've got, yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S18","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":18,"global_order":365,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"we've got, cause right now, obviously we've got, there are higher levels of loneliness than ever before - people have lower average numbers of close friendships than ever before.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S19","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":19,"global_order":366,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We're being put into silos and we're then being encouraged by social media to communicate only with people who are on the same polarized opinion as ours.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S20","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":20,"global_order":367,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So we're actually","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S21","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":21,"global_order":368,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"and the fragmented social media type, communicative media.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S22","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":22,"global_order":369,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So when you talk about a road trip, one of the things you said that really struck me was.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S23","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":23,"global_order":370,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You're going to have some crashes.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S24","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":24,"global_order":371,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You've got to learn how to be on that road trip with other people.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S25","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":25,"global_order":372,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"We're all getting much less practice at how to live together, how to be in a space together.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.826737+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S