t":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S92","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":92,"global_order":439,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S93","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":93,"global_order":440,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S94","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":94,"global_order":441,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There's a really great way to do it here.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S95","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":95,"global_order":442,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm giving you a guarantee.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S96","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":96,"global_order":443,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I'm giving my personal guarantee and that's, isn't that interesting because when you get, when you exist in groups, when you exist in tribes, then you tap in to that shared wisdom of all the members of the tribe.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC03-S97","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":3,"scene_label":"Chapter 3","scene_title":"Intensive Sprints as Road Trips","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":97,"global_order":444,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"You have all these people who might find something interesting and come and tell you about it, or might find something important that you need to learn about or understand and come and tell you about that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S01","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":1,"global_order":445,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And when we're not doing that, the people who are deciding what we should be seeing, what we should be responding to are the people who are writing algorithms for Facebook.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S02","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":2,"global_order":446,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And they're driving us up into polarization.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S03","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":3,"global_order":447,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And actually we need our tribes as the antidote to this one-to-Facebook relationship that we're all starting to get to used to.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S04","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":4,"global_order":448,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Very interesting that's a, probably another piece to talk about that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S05","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":5,"global_order":449,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I'd quite like that later...","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S06","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":6,"global_order":450,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Staying on the idea of sort of high-intensity shared experiences learning.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S07","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":7,"global_order":451,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Talk to me about how your approach you think could work, say for learning.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S08","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":8,"global_order":452,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"for students in schools who want to learn English, Chinese speakers, cause we're practical cause we're building this right now.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S09","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":9,"global_order":453,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"How might you see it working, given your experience of really getting the best results with the minimum, total resources, what are the different ways that you could see that shared experience combination sort of work?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S10","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":10,"global_order":454,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"We can't take, typically we could run summer camps.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S100","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":100,"global_order":544,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"In that there are going to be groups so you can see you've got some 14 or 15 year olds who've actually worked really hard at their English.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S101","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":101,"global_order":545,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and whose spoken is extremely low and they don't, they have that sort of sense of failure and a lack of confidence and you're going to have groups in that where you put them into a two day kickstart at the end of that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S102","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":102,"global_order":546,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"They will have had such a gear change in terms of their own confidence.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S103","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":103,"global_order":547,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It'll be they'll, there'll be, yeah, that will be your remarkable thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S104","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":104,"global_order":548,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"They'll already be saying it did this in just two days.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S105","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":105,"global_order":549,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"This isn't a possible thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S106","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":106,"global_order":550,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And then you say, are you willing to commit to, two hours a week for the rest of the year,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S107","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":107,"global_order":551,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"top of the relevant?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S11","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":11,"global_order":455,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"We could do that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S12","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":12,"global_order":456,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"We could do that sort of thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S13","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":13,"global_order":457,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Or we could do things at weekends, we could do things after school.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S14","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":14,"global_order":458,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"We can't usually take kids out of school for five days or 10 days to do that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S15","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":15,"global_order":459,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S16","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":16,"global_order":460,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Talk to me about, so any thoughts you've got on that?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S17","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":17,"global_order":461,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"it's been a long old while.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S18","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":18,"global_order":462,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Since I have to operate in a school environment with school constraints.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S19","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":19,"global_order":463,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I'm out of practice there and haven't spent a lot of time thinking about it, but if I was allowed to give one roll of the dice, what I would most want to test would be a very simple structure.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S20","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":20,"global_order":464,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And it would just be one day a week.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S21","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":21,"global_order":465,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S22","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":22,"global_order":466,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And the reason I'd want to test that - because obviously that looks like a big bite out of the school time - but I would want to test that because I suspect that would not even need an entire year until there was no point for the children in that first cohort to be doing it anymore because their English was fine.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S23","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":23,"global_order":467,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"And I'm thinking that outside of, for school aged children, but outside the constraints of the Monday to Friday school, one day a week, a Saturday or a Sunday is easily doable.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S24","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":24,"global_order":468,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So you're thinking how many again, based on your experience, just picking a number out of the air, how many hours do you think of learning with your system?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S25","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":25,"global_order":469,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"In the intensive, but group format would be transformational in terms of being able to be comfortable using it.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S26","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":26,"global_order":470,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I'd say, I think ballpark, yeah in that kind of environment, it's slightly different to working with adults.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S27","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":27,"global_order":471,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I tend to say seriously, if you're spending one day on this, why would you stop until you're ready to sleep?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S28","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":28,"global_order":472,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Because it's just one day you've already.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S29","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":29,"global_order":473,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Not done all the other things you could have done that day because you weren't committed to.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S30","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":30,"global_order":474,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So if you're a bit tired at four o'clock, what are you going to gain by stopping pushed through too late?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S31","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":31,"global_order":475,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"do you, do you.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S32","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":32,"global_order":476,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"1210, 11, 12 hour days.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S33","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":33,"global_order":477,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"They do nine till nine.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S34","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":34,"global_order":478,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S35","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":35,"global_order":479,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I reckon, I think it's a bit self-defeating for an adult learner to sign up to an intensive day and then do less than 10 hours.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S36","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":36,"global_order":480,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S37","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":37,"global_order":481,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"yeah, For children who are already usually overloaded in schools, And who are not given enough downtime to, even for proper consolidation of their subjects, and who are generally speaking under quite a lot of pressure.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S38","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":38,"global_order":482,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I would think that they had done a very valuable day if they did six hours and I will be entirely comfortable with saying this is going to be a four hour thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S39","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":39,"global_order":483,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So a half day.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S40","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":40,"global_order":484,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And I think what would happen is that if you've got a cohort doing six hours a day, one day a week, by the end of a term, they're going to be getting some staggering results,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S41","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":41,"global_order":485,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"10, 15 weeks, something like that yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S42","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":42,"global_order":486,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S43","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":43,"global_order":487,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I would expect if they're doing this, six hours is probably not far off.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S44","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":44,"global_order":488,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S45","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":45,"global_order":489,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"you can do more than that, but you're getting, you're cracking on through a lot of stuff there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S46","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":46,"global_order":490,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"so I would say, 12 to 15 days of that - particularly for people who've come through and education system, that's tried to teach them a lot of English because it's going to activate all that passive stuff for them.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S47","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":47,"global_order":491,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"By end of term one, those people will be getting results that they're excited about.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S48","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":48,"global_order":492,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S49","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":49,"global_order":493,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"If you get people who are doing a three or four hour one, and I will be encouraging them to think that this is a program for that year, But I would expect them at the end of the year to be quite excited.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S50","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":50,"global_order":494,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S51","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":51,"global_order":495,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So my question would be, what are we trying to do longterm business?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S52","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":52,"global_order":496,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Ah, we're not trying to create a business model, which pays us every month forever.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S53","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":53,"global_order":497,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"We're trying to get people to be able to.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S54","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":54,"global_order":498,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Be able to learn new things and learn languages and get them up to speed as quickly as possible.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S55","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":55,"global_order":499,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Really.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S56","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":56,"global_order":500,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So would it be more remarkable again, Seth Godin sense, would it be more remarkable for us to just get people half a day a week for say six months and then that's it they're done.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S57","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":57,"global_order":501,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"If they want to get other stuff with us then fine - fantastic.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S58","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":58,"global_order":502,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"If they want to practice, if they want to pay a monthly fee or whatever then fine, b