:"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S66","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":66,"global_order":510,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"More like","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S67","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":67,"global_order":511,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"kids go to school Monday to Friday.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S68","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":68,"global_order":512,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So for them to do then a whole day, Saturday, or a whole day, Sunday, even four hours, it's going to be quite limited in its sort of appeal.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S69","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":69,"global_order":513,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"So it might be something around two hours a week is definitely doable on a continuous basis.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S70","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":70,"global_order":514,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Again, I'm riffing, but I'm just thinking,","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S71","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":71,"global_order":515,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I think the thing is to a large extent that I'm particularly in the context of China, where you know that you're working with a body of learners who have had quite a lot of unsuccessful attempts to give them this language and what that means is - okay it means there's a little bit of kind of emotional scar tissue there, learning English doesn't really work.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S72","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":72,"global_order":516,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It's tough - but it also means that they have got quite a lot of passive vocabulary.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S73","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":73,"global_order":517,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yes.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S74","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":74,"global_order":518,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"residual.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S75","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":75,"global_order":519,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yes.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S76","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":76,"global_order":520,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And on the brain is clearly very good at that passive vocabulary they've got is already to a certain extent, neurally linked.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S77","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":77,"global_order":521,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S78","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":78,"global_order":522,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So when you get a little kind of child, when you use one word there.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S79","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":79,"global_order":523,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"There's spillover like a sort of electrical leak, possibly also actual electrical leak.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S80","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":80,"global_order":524,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So you get an activation impact on the rest of the neurological circuit.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S81","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":81,"global_order":525,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"and we've just seen this over and over and over again.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S82","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":82,"global_order":526,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So I would expect act that, secondary level students in China are going to get some moments of sudden blossoming might a lot of the previous dry unsuccessful stuff starts to come to life for that.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S83","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":83,"global_order":527,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Cause they, by then they've had probably eight to 10 years of English exposure.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S84","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":84,"global_order":528,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"Anyway.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S85","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":85,"global_order":529,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"I'm really interested in this too, to know where the, a kickstart plus a one and a half hour, two hours a week would be perhaps the thing then?","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S86","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":86,"global_order":530,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"I think you've got to test that, but I certainly think that two hours a week is going to give us a hundred hours by the end of the year.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC04-S87","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":4,"scene_label":"Chapter 4","scene_title":"Your Own Tribe v The Facebook Algorithm","scene_subtitle":null