d_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":7,"global_order":558,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S08","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":8,"global_order":559,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And the thing probably","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S09","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":9,"global_order":560,"speaker":"TOM","english_text":"because younger children as well, cause they've maybe been learning it even by the age of eight or 10, they've been learning English for four or five years.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S10","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":10,"global_order":561,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"A little bit like something that happens in Ireland actually - only heard about fairly recently - that basically they all have to have Irish for the leaving certificate.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S11","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":11,"global_order":562,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Gotcha.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S12","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":12,"global_order":563,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"so they all sit there in Irish classes, bored and not doing particularly well.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S13","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":13,"global_order":564,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And they've got to get through the exam at the end of it, just before the exam.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S14","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":14,"global_order":565,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"So it's probably something like, the summer before their final year, but that there's this sort of time.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S15","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":15,"global_order":566,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"It might just be the learn our holiday that there's basically that there's a time when all the middle class parents in Dublin send their kids to the Gaeltacht for the week to Jesus Christ, try and get through this thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S16","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":16,"global_order":567,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Now, what you just said that I think would actually - there's a bookend approach - so I think you say we do a five day kickstart, in the summer you then do a year of one or two hours a week, and then you do a five day.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S17","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":17,"global_order":568,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Five day take off thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S18","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":18,"global_order":569,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And that last five day take off thing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S19","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":19,"global_order":570,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"A big chunk of that is going to be just immersion.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S20","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":20,"global_order":571,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S21","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":21,"global_order":572,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And they're just going to be, Oh my God, we're having fun.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S22","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":22,"global_order":573,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"And you get entertaining stuff and game playing.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S23","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":23,"global_order":574,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Yeah.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S24","pod_slug":"talk-bollocks-2","scene_number":5,"scene_label":"Chapter 5","scene_title":"Ideal Way For Chinese Students To Learn English","scene_subtitle":null,"difficulty":null,"sentence_number":24,"global_order":575,"speaker":"ARAN","english_text":"Kind of stuff going on.","author_notes":null,"created_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","updated_at":"2026-10-20 22:40:22.958257+00","variant_key":null,"target_text":null,"target_lang":null,"attach_sentence_number":null},{"id":"talk-bollocks-2:SC05-S25","pod_slug":"talk-bollo